			"notes": "## Fixes\n\n- **Ender chests now reliably blocked.** When `disableEnderChests` is enabled, the ender chest menu can no longer be opened — blocking now happens at the block-interaction source via `EnderChestBlockMixin` instead of the event callback, which did not reliably prevent the menu from opening.\n- **Combat logging only triggers on player damage.** Taking damage from mobs or the environment (PvE) no longer combat-tags a player. Only player-vs-player damage starts the combat timer.\n\nBuilt for Minecraft 26.2 (Fabric).\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/PottersGame/combat-persistance/compare/v1.5.0...v1.6.0"
		},
